# AGENTS.md is the durable project context and must be versioned here, even
# though a global gitignore excludes it by default.
!AGENTS.md

# Same story for public/: a global `Public/` rule matches it on case-insensitive
# filesystems, which would silently drop the Workers Assets `_headers` file from
# the repo — and therefore from the deployed build.
!public/
